    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      582.24,
      508.75,
      592.31
    ],
    "text": "Finance and Gurantee Company Ltd., requesting them to pay Gratuity to the Applicant within 14 days.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      603.84,
      555.07,
      613.91
    ],
    "text": "Since the Respondent failed to pay the Gratuity, Commissioner of Labour filed a case on 27.04.2017. According to the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      619.44,
      554.64,
      629.51
    ],
    "text": "document marked R 10 said case bearing No 73/984 of Magistrate Court Fort was withdrawn by the Commissioner",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      634.8,
      392.01,
      644.87
    ],
    "text": "of Labour stating that there was no legal basis to continue with the case.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      655.2,
      442.18,
      665.27
    ],
    "text": "During the cross examination by the applicant's lawyer, the witness stated as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      678.96,
      554.89,
      689.03
    ],
    "text": "The witness stated according to A 18, Respondent was ordered to pay to the Applicant a sum of Rs. 28,29,600/= as",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      694.56,
      487.98,
      704.63
    ],
    "text": "the gratuity and a sum of Rs. 5,65,920/= as the Surcharge amounting total sum of Rs. 33,95,520.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      719.76,
      410.0,
      729.83
    ],
    "text": "The letter marked as R 10 has given the reason for the withdrawal of the case.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.52,
      46.56,
      562.62,
      69.11
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'08'015 APART 1: SEC. (1) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 01.08.2018",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.953384876251221,
      10.070319175720215,
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      79.44,
      562.3,
      89.51
    ],
    "text": "The witness further stated that the previous employer was The Finance Company but in R10 it was errorneously",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      95.04,
      293.11,
      105.11
    ],
    "text": "stated as The Finance and Gurantee Company.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      114.48,
      561.6,
      124.55
    ],
    "text": "The witness further admitted that the respondent company has not challenged the order given by the Commissioner",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      129.84,
      239.14,
      139.91
    ],
    "text": "of Labour in the Court of Appeal.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      149.52,
      383.89,
      159.59
    ],
    "text": "In overall analysis of evidence I have come to following conclusions.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      99.6,
      168.96,
      562.26,
      179.03
    ],
    "text": "I.It is evident that the Applicant has worked for the Respondent Company for a period of 11 years 01.07.1998 to",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      184.56,
      562.02,
      194.63
    ],
    "text": "31.05.2010. According to the Gratuity act No 12 of 1983 she was paid a sum of Rs. 1,604,879.82 far in excess what",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      199.92,
      257.58,
      209.99
    ],
    "text": "she was entitled under Gratuity Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      96.72,
      219.36,
      562.19,
      229.43
    ],
    "text": "II.It is evident that the Applicant as a senior accountant obtaining an excessive sum of Rs. 1,604,879.82 as the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      234.96,
      202.93,
      245.03
    ],
    "text": "Gratuity was improper.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      93.6,
      254.4,
      561.82,
      264.47
    ],
    "text": "III.It is clear that the Commissioner of Labour has no power to order to calculate the gratuity in excess half month",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      270.0,
      351.41,
      280.07
    ],
    "text": "salary for a year in service as stipulated in the Gratuity Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      95.28,
      289.44,
      562.3,
      299.51
    ],
    "text": "IV. It is evident that gratuity become liable in terms of payment of Gratuity Act only when there is a termination of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      305.04,
      561.97,
      315.11
    ],
    "text": "employment, since there has been no termination of service of the applicant it is not justifiable to calculate a sum",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      320.4,
      470.71,
      330.47
    ],
    "text": "of Rs. 223,125/= as her gratuity from her previous employer - The Finance Company PLC.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      98.16,
      339.84,
      484.82,
      349.91
    ],
    "text": "V.It is evident that the Applicant's employment with the Respondent Company was a new one.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      93.6,
      359.52,
      562.06,
      369.59
    ],
    "text": "VI.The Applicant has acted unfairly and fraudulently by obtaining the gratuity far in excess what she was entitled",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      113.04,
      374.88,
      253.04,
      384.95
    ],
    "text": "under the Payment of Gratuity Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      394.56,
      562.06,
      404.63
    ],
    "text": "For the reasons aforesaid it is my finding that the Respondent Company (party of the second part) has caused no",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      409.92,
      303.6,
      419.99
    ],
    "text": "injustice to the applicant. (party of the First part).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      429.36,
      561.94,
      439.43
    ],
    "text": "In the circumstances taking into consideration the totality of evidence led before me I dismiss the complaint made",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      444.96,
      175.54,
      455.03
    ],
    "text": "by the Applciant.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      464.4,
      561.75,
      474.47
    ],
    "text": "I Further make order that this award should be implemented within 21 days of the publication in the Government",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      480.0,
      336.91,
      490.07
    ],
    "text": "Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      105.84,
      499.44,
      266.91,
      509.51
    ],
    "text": "I consider this award just and equitable.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
